系補造個人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p078","text":"鄭人或賣其國於秦，秦繆公發兵往襲鄭。十二月，秦兵過我郊。襄公元年春，秦師過周，無禮，王孫滿譏之。兵至滑，鄭賈人絃髙將市于周，遇之，以十二牛勞秦師。秦師驚而還，滅滑而去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m078-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"鄭人或","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m078-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"秦繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m078-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m078-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"王孫滿","kind":"person","person_id":"fie_vij_hw2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m078-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"絃髙","kind":"person","person_id":"v8l_ue6_un4","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p021","text":"八年，伐陸渾戎，遂至洛，觀兵於周郊。周定王使王孫滿勞楚王。楚王問鼎小大輕重，對曰：「在德不在鼎。」莊王曰：「子無阻九鼎！楚國折鉤之喙，足以爲九鼎。」王孫滿曰：「嗚呼！君王其忘之乎？昔虞夏之盛，遠方皆至，貢金九牧，鑄鼎象物，百物而爲之備，使民知神姦。桀有亂德，鼎遷於殷，載祀六百。殷紂暴虐，鼎遷於周。德之休明，雖小必重；其姦回昏亂，雖大必輕。昔成王定鼎于郟鄏，卜世三十，卜年七百，天所命也。周德雖衰，天命未改。鼎之輕重，未可問也。」楚王乃歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"周定王","kind":"person","person_id":"ima_dfc_4lp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"王孫滿","kind":"person","person_id":"fie_vij_hw2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m021-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"0va_zus_2zt_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":